<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend Communications.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co research analyst Paul Johnson raised his estimates today on Ascend Communications, Inc. and reiterated a Buy rating.</p>
<p>-- cited very strong fourth quarter results with revenues of $177.5 million and EPS of $0.32.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1997 estimate to $1.61 from $1.50.</p>
</text>
